  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your passion for baseball with the Jeminise Personalized Baseball Comforter Set. This bedding set offers a unique way to celebrate your favorite sport while providing a comfortable and stylish addition to any bedroom. Perfect for baseball players, fans, or anyone who loves the game, this set combines personalized charm with cozy comfort.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Ideal for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques to hold dye and prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Microfiber Filling:</strong> Whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization:</strong> Features options for personalized text inputs to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
